  "title": "Grilled Avocado Tacos",
  "description": "Grilled avocados on a warm corn tortilla topped with a fresh salsa made from grilled corn, black beans, jalapeño, cilantro and lime juice from Dan Seidman of The Chef Dan.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
